      "created_at": "2014-05-16T11:48:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Good to see that it means all plating cards \"IN PLAY\", but I was looking for a bit of clarity on what \"in play\" means exactly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Do cards under other cards count as \"in play\"? For example, if I place Bunker's Maintenance Unit under his Omni-Cannon, and later someone plays a card which says Bunker must destroy and equipment, is he allowed to destroy his Maintenance Unit, or must he destroy Omni-Cannon if he has no other options?</li></ul>",
