      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Oh and I suppose I should point out this one uncommon but rather fun exception. There is an environment card in the Time Cataclysm Deck called &quot;Fixed Point&quot; which declares that all card are indestructible. This covers cards that would be returned to your hand in the manner that swapping out plating does. In the one rare instance that card comes into play, you may lay out multiple plating cards. Mr. Fixer and the Naturalist also love &quot;Fixed Point&quot; as well. :)</p>",
